                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">RECAP  -  Top profile
Goal: a second, smaller outline for the roof.
Idea: The same Polygon you built in Level A, with its own radius
   and fillet. It sits on the ground for now: the next steps
   lift it and twist it.</item>
