                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9f91a260-bd6a-465d-b942-ddeec0f97aff</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 3  -  Copy the profile to the top
Goal: the top outline sitting at roof height.
Idea: Transforms output a moved copy: the original stays where
   it was.
Wire check: outline -&gt; G (Geometry), vector -&gt; T (Motion).</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>1826.7739</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>270.06836</W>
                          <H>59.842773</H>
