                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">1c4084e7-287a-4642-8a63-95d94122d52e</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 4  -  Twist the top
Goal: the roof outline turned by the twist angle.
Idea: A rotation needs a centre (the tower's centre point) and
   an angle.
Watch for: Angle is in radians unless the A input is set to
   Degrees (right-click A &gt; Degrees).
Wire check: twist slider -&gt; A, centre point -&gt; P.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>2166.8423</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>257.15723</W>
                          <H>80.43555</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>2171.8423</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="38">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
