                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL B - Build the twisting mass  |  B01 (Simple method)  |  Twisty tower series - WALKTHROUGH.  Units: feet.
One concept per stage. Every stage opens with a note:  Goal (what it makes)  -  Idea (the concept)  -  Watch for (common mistakes)  -  Wire check (which input a wire goes into).
GIVEN = built in an earlier level, pre-placed, not quizzed.  RECAP = a node you already know, not quizzed.  STEP n = quizzed: red B01_Q## is the question node.
Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.  Built only from components the PathOGen solver supports.
Questions: B01_Q01 Multiplication   B01_Q02 Unit Z   B01_Q03 Move   B01_Q04 Rotate   B01_Q05 Loft   B01_Q06 Cap Holes   B01_Q07 Area</item>
